{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1059","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Sequence Transformation"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call the following process a transformation of a sequence of length $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the sequence is empty, the process ends. Otherwise, append the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greatest_common_divisor"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"greatest common divisor"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" (GCD) of all the elements of the sequence to the result and remove one arbitrary element from the sequence. Thus, when the process ends, we have a sequence of $$$n$$$ integers: the greatest common divisors of all the elements in the sequence before each deletion."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer sequence $$$1, 2, \\dots, n$$$. Find the lexicographically maximum result of its transformation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A sequence $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ is lexicographically larger than a sequence $$$b_1, b_2, \\ldots, b_n$$$, if there is an index $$$i$$$ such that $$$a_j = b_j$$$ for all $$$j \\lt i$$$, and $$$a_i \\gt b_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line of input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1\\le n\\le 10^6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output $$$n$$$ integers  — the lexicographically maximum result of the transformation."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 1 3 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 2 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample the answer may be achieved this way:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Append GCD$$$(1, 2, 3) = 1$$$, remove $$$2$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Append GCD$$$(1, 3) = 1$$$, remove $$$1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Append GCD$$$(3) = 3$$$, remove $$$3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We get the sequence $$$[1, 1, 3]$$$ as the result."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1059C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1059/problem/C"}